{"severity":"error","file":"errors/role_grant_exceeded_2.march","start_line":39,"start_col":82,"end_line":39,"end_col":86,"message":"Role `Stream.Cons` is granted `Cap(IO.NetConnect)` (`role Cons needs IO.NetConnect`), but the body passed to `Stream_Run.run_Cons` reaches `IO.FileWrite` (reached from the body: body → wipe). A role's grant bounds everything its code reaches, as `main`'s grant bounds the program.\nhelp: add `IO.FileWrite` to `role Cons needs ...` in protocol `Stream`, or remove the use.","code":"role_grant_exceeded","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[]}
